{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity went through 7 eras that made them collapse and then adapt, travel with your motorcycle to discover what they were. From the normality of the forest, a global drought... to the technological triumph that made them survive the universe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3D arcade platform game that will challenge your abilities and reflexes. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through each level, demonstrating your skill, with progressive difficulty in each era, and collect gems to unlock the most difficult levels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, avoid obstacles, or take advantage of them to achieve your goals, whether it's finishing early or being able to reach places you normally couldn't. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your speed with 3 base gears that will help you reach the goal and your objectives.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4037070?t=1760263594","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4037070?t=1760263594","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037070/eb42d429add7d34d14b4a778209aa5fc2dd9e5d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760263594","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037070/eb42d429add7d34d14b4a778209aa5fc2dd9e5d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760263594","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity went through 7 eras that made them collapse and then adapt, travel with your motorcycle to discover what they were. From the normality of the forest, a global drought... to the technological triumph that made them survive the universe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3D arcade platform game that will challenge your abilities and reflexes. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through each level, demonstrating your skill, with progressive difficulty in each era, and collect gems to unlock the most difficult levels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, avoid obstacles, or take advantage of them to achieve your goals, whether it's finishing early or being able to reach places you normally couldn't. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your speed with 3 base gears that will help you reach the goal and your objectives.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Michi Soul Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037070/fe3f72a347582883c6ba8213a374f128e68dbe6a/header.jpg?t=1760263594","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4037070/1868666285/92f69d9d1ecaf75dbbd8c75d164ceb72532d6e19/1757942822/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759782267","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4037070/1868666285/92f69d9d1ecaf75dbbd8c75d164ceb72532d6e19/1757942822/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759782267","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4037070/1868666285/92f69d9d1ecaf75dbbd8c75d164ceb72532d6e19/1757942822/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759782267","id":257198041,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257198041/movie480.mp4?t=1759782267","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257198041/movie_max.mp4?t=1759782267"},"name":"Jumping Eras","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257198041/48b279174d0588d25bf9a6a76566efaca2d74f83/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759782267","webm":{"480":"https://